arm64: dts: h713: twi1 with the accelerometer of the auto keystone (keystone S8)

The vendor's auto keystone reads a 3-axis accelerometer on twi1 at 0x18: a Silan
SC7A20 or a Sensortek STK83xx, decided at runtime by the vendor driver
(re-apps AP2b). The stock DT listed four candidate children; ours had them
copied and the bus disabled because nothing used it.

twi1 is enabled again on the board and carries one node, compatible
"silan,sc7a20", which mainline's st_accel binds (WHO_AM_I 0x11). If the part
turns out to be the Sensortek one, the probe fails cleanly and one i2c read of
register 0x00 through /dev/i2c-1 names it (plan/keystone S8, slot 9). The patch sits at the end of the
series because 0082 carries the board's old twi1 line as context.. No
interrupt property: the keystone reader polls in_accel_*_raw; no mount-matrix:
the vendor's transform is an axis swap done in userspace (AP2h) and the three-
pose measurement decides. The board defconfig adds CONFIG_IIO_ST_ACCEL_3AXIS
and CONFIG_IIO_ST_ACCEL_I2C_3AXIS as modules (changed alongside).

--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-h713.dtsi	2026-09-22 20:07:23.607524539 +0200
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-h713.dtsi	2026-09-22 20:07:23.626570484 +0200
@@ -793,32 +793,20 @@
 			#size-cells = <0>;
 			status = "okay";
 
-			/* Stock TWI1 children (from live DTS dump) */
-			stk8ba58@18 {
-				compatible = "stk,stk83xx";
+			/*
+			 * The accelerometer behind the vendor's auto keystone: one chip
+			 * at 0x18, a Silan SC7A20 (LIS2DH-compatible, st_accel) or a
+			 * Sensortek STK83xx, chosen at runtime by the vendor's driver
+			 * (re-apps AP2b). The stock DT listed four candidates; this is
+			 * the one mainline has a driver for. No interrupt line: the
+			 * reader polls, and the stock's PB0 pin is not wired here until
+			 * measured. No mount-matrix: the vendor's transform is an axis
+			 * swap in userspace (AP2h), settled by the three-pose
+			 * measurement of plan/keystone S8.
+			 */
+			accelerometer@18 {
+				compatible = "silan,sc7a20";
 				reg = <0x18>;
-				status = "okay";
-				stk,direction = <2>;
-				stk,prj_pianzhou = <1>;
-				stk,swipe_xy = <0>;
-			};
-
-			kxttj3@e {
-				compatible = "kxtj3";
-				reg = <0x0e>;  /* stock: name @18 but reg=0x0e */
-				status = "disabled";
-			};
-
-			da228ec@27 {
-				compatible = "mir3da";
-				reg = <0x27>;  /* stock: name @0e but reg=0x27 */
-				status = "okay";
-			};
-
-			lsm6dsr@6a {
-				compatible = "lsm6dsr";
-				reg = <0x6a>;
-				status = "disabled";
 			};
 
